Subject: Add support for additional .NET architectures (#217)

* Initial work for arch/plat .NET profiler support

* set default arch

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/Sysinternals/ProcDump-for-Linux/commit/ed78e3e8ef57a52a8c69f4592436321ef6e9b960
